BT /F1 9 Tf 45.35 404.79 Td (1. Print this page at 100% \(Actual size\) on ordinary paper. Confirm the 20 mm scale is truly 2 cm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 45.35 388.91 Td (2. Choose the opening that matches your phone flash. 8 mm suits a small LED, 10 mm most phones,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 45.35 373.04 Td (    12 mm a larger flash.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 45.35 357.17 Td (3. Cut along the solid star outline. Keep the dashed rectangle as a small paper frame.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 45.35 341.29 Td (4. Centre the star over the rear flash \(use the tick marks\) and tape the frame to the phone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 45.35 325.42 Td (    Do not cover cameras or microphones.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 45.35 309.54 Td (5. In a dark room, shine the flash at a wall or ceiling. The star will appear in the beam.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 45.35 293.67 Td (6. This is a stencil for the phone flash only. It is not for use as a flame or with candles.) Tj ET
